OL,3,GNEWSACentury-old cafe prepares for
OL,4,Aclosure
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter more than 106 years in business a
OL,7,Fcafe is to close its doors for the
OL,8,Ffinal time.
OL,10,FSue Dugan, whose grandparents opened
OL,11,FValentes Cafe in Church Street in
OL,12,FSeaham, County Durham, in 1920 said it
OL,13,Fhad been a "difficult decision" to shut
OL,14,Fand she would miss the customers.
OL,16,FThe family-owned business was founded
OL,17,Fby Frank and Carmela Valente in 1920
OL,18,Fand had been passed down two
OL,19,Fgenerations to Dugan and the couple's
OL,20,Fother grandaughter Maria Blain, who are
OL,21,Fco-owners.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
